<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>On the altar now we lay</l><l>Soul and body, mind and will;</l><l>All the evil passions slay,</l><l>Come, and every corner fill.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now the sacrifice we make,</l><l>Though as dear as a right eye,</l><l>For our blessed Savior’s sake,</l><l>Who for us did bleed and die.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now, by faith, the gift I claim,</l><l>Bought for me by blood divine:</l><l>Through the all-prevailing Name</l><l>All the promises are mine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
